1
00:00:14,285 --> 00:00:20,285
If you're searching for new adventure, "this is the way."

2
00:00:28,571 --> 00:00:34,571
Star Wars: The Mandalorian and Grogu is a action, adventure,
science fiction film directed by Jon Favreau.

3
00:00:42,857 --> 00:00:48,857
The evil Empire has fallen, and Imperial warlords
remain scattered throughout the galaxy.

4
00:00:57,142 --> 00:01:03,142
As the fledgling New Republic works to protect everything the Rebellion fought for, they have enlisted
the help of legendary Mandalorian bounty hunter Din Djarin and his young apprentice Grogu.

5
00:01:11,428 --> 00:01:17,428
Din Djarin / The Mandalorian, played by Pedro Pascal.

6
00:01:25,714 --> 00:01:31,714
Zeb (voice), played by Steve Blum.

7
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:46,000
Colonel Ward, played by Sigourney Weaver.

8
00:01:54,285 --> 00:02:00,285
Rotta the Hutt (voice), played by Jeremy Allen White.

9
00:02:08,571 --> 00:02:14,571
Imperial Warlord, played by Jonny Coyne.

10
00:02:22,857 --> 00:02:28,857
Trapper Wolf, played by Dave Filoni.

11
00:02:37,142 --> 00:02:43,142
The Mandalorian and Grogu, also known as Star Wars: The Mandalorian and Grogu, is an upcoming
American film directed by Jon Favreau and co-written by Favreau and Dave Filoni.

12
00:02:51,428 --> 00:02:57,428
Produced by Lucasfilm and set to be distributed by Walt Disney Studios Motion Pictures, it is part of the Star
Wars franchise and a continuation of the Disney+ television series The Mandalorian (2019–2023).

13
00:03:05,714 --> 00:03:11,714
The film stars Pedro Pascal as Din Djarin / The Mandalorian, alongside
Sigourney Weaver, Jeremy Allen White, and Jonny Coyne.

14
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:26,000
Favreau and Filoni had written a fourth season of The Mandalorian by February 2023, but
production on the season was delayed by the 2023 Hollywood labor disputes.

15
00:03:34,285 --> 00:03:40,285
During this time, Lucasfilm re-evaluated their plans for the franchise and
decided to prioritize a Mandalorian film over the fourth season.

16
00:03:48,571 --> 00:03:54,571
The Mandalorian and Grogu was announced in January 2024.

17
00:04:02,857 --> 00:04:08,857
Filming began in California by August 2024 and was completed by that December.

18
00:04:17,142 --> 00:04:23,142
The Mandalorian and Grogu is scheduled to be released
in the United States on May 22, 2026.

19
00:04:31,428 --> 00:04:37,428
The film explores themes of galaxy, bounty hunter,
space opera, based on tv series.

20
00:04:45,714 --> 00:04:51,714
The tone is thought_provoking.
